+
+- prompt: `12794c9b475e4c41b878cf4d466feb8fa24d9d3dd6311f9845760f64b4748fd4`;
+- translator: `406485eac118431c08ef59f30f79dfa6aa9d5825408917fc5ce7c806e664db16`.
+
